  "description": "Meet the all-new Mudfest Plus, built for riders who would rather take on the rough stuff than find a way around it.\n\nDesigned around 29 × 2.4\" tyre clearance, the Mudfest Plus features an entirely new rear yoke design to accommodate bigger tyres without compromising the character of the frame. Built with Reynolds 725 heat-treated chromoly tubing and an all-new geometry, it's designed to take on rough trails, keep things composed and make every ride a little more adventurous.\n\nBikepacking was always part of the plan. With generous mounting options across the frame and fork, there's plenty of room to carry your gear and head out for longer adventures.\n\nA little more tyre, a little more freedom, and a lot more reasons to explore.",
